# BUGS

No program on it sees a terminal, since its standard streams are pipes: no termios, no window size.
Scrolling regions, the alternate screen, wide characters, selection and copy are not there yet.
Its throughput is a third of 00 §8's budget (docs/milestones/known-gaps.md).
